OL,3,GNEWSARoof severely damaged after stray
OL,4,Afirework hits house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire caused by a stray firework has
OL,7,Fseverely damaged the roof of a house in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FFire crews were called to the blaze in
OL,11,FSussex Road, Wigston, at about 21:30
OL,12,FGMT on Thursday.
OL,14,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,Fsent five engines, plus an aerial
OL,16,Fladder platform, and worked "through
OL,17,Fthe night" to extinguish the blaze.
OL,19,FA spokesperson for the service said
OL,20,Fthat while no-one was injured in the
OL,21,Ffire, the incident "could have been a
OL,22,Flot worse".
